<p>Family and travel features should be read off the current plan, not memorised. Some products let a household share a subset of items without handing over the whole vault. Some have offered a way to pull sensitive vaults off a device before a border crossing. The name, the steps, and whether the feature is included in your tier all change. Confirm them on the help page you trust this month. A border question is a legal situation. This article does not tell you what to say. It tells you to learn, before you fly, whether the app can remove items and how you put them back.</p>
