<p>A single-country plan and a regional plan are different purchases even when the price looks close. If you will cross a border, read whether the regional plan includes every country on the route or only a list with a hole in the middle. A day in a country that is not on the list is a day of roaming or a day offline. Adding a second plan can be cheaper or more confusing. The calculator will compare any two totals you type. It will not know that the second plan's clock overlaps the first. Write the dates down next to the totals so you do not pay two plans for the same Tuesday.</p>
